<title>SPAIN: Popular cuts consumer credit, mortgage rates.</title>
<headline>Popular cuts consumer credit, mortgage rates.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular said it had reduced its consumer credit and mortgage loan rates effective on Thursday.</p>
<p>Popular said it cut its consumer loan rates by 75 basis points to 9.75 percent and reduced its mortgage rates by 50 basis points to 6.50 percent.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
